sequenceDiagram
    participant Producer
    participant Main as orders (TTL 30s, x-dead-letter-exchange)
    participant Consumer
    participant DLX as dlx (direct)
    participant DLQ as orders.dead
    participant Inspector as Dead Letter Consumer
    Producer->>Main: publish order
    Main->>Consumer: deliver
    Consumer->>Main: nack (requeue = false)
    Main->>DLX: dead letter, reason = rejected
    DLX->>DLQ: routing key = orders
    DLQ->>Inspector: deliver for retry or inspection
    Producer->>Main: publish order
    Main->>DLX: dead letter, reason = expired (TTL)
    DLX->>DLQ: routing key = orders
